    "text": "12",
    "x": 875,
    "y": 500,
    "width": 36,
    "height": 14.64,
    "size": 12
  },
  {
    "slide": 12,
    "text": "What slowed me down",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 12,
    "text": "Agents wanted to audit\neverything before acting.\n\nI often wanted a small\ntrial-and-error experiment.",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 12,
    "text": "What I would change",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 12,
    "text": "For a cheap, reversible test:\nname the question and try it.\n\nBefore expensive runs or claims:\ncheck the evidence and provenance.",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 12,
    "text": "The question is when a check changes the next decision.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 421,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 29.28,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "slide": 12,
    "text": "Proposed workflow change; no measured time saving is claimed.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 465,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 19.52,
    "size": 16
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "03 / WHAT THE WORKFLOW COST",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 24,
    "width": 860,
    "height": 13.42,
    "size": 11
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "My active time shifted into orchestration and routing",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 52,
    "width": 872,
    "height": 35.2,
    "size": 32
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "Joseph\u2019s account \u00b7 Historical WAKER F2/F3 failures \u00b7 OI-135 watcher question and implementation decision",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 501,
    "width": 803,
    "height": 12.2,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "13",
    "x": 875,
    "y": 500,
    "width": 36,
    "height": 14.64,
    "size": 12
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "The work I remember doing",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "Debugging coordination,\naccount routing and wakeups.\n\nThe logs include wrong executable\npaths and Python environments.",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "A simpler tool can help",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "\u201cWhy do we even need an\nLLM for the watcher?\u201d\n\nA defined job outcome can be\nreported by an ordinary script.",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "That overhead belongs in any account of productivity.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 421,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 29.28,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "slide": 13,
    "text": "The record supports concrete failures; it does not supply a complete time budget.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 465,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 19.52,
    "size": 16
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "04 / BECOMING A RESEARCHER",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 24,
    "width": 860,
    "height": 13.42,
    "size": 11
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "Outside expertise corrected the question itself",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 52,
    "width": 872,
    "height": 35.2,
    "size": 32
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "COLLABORATOR_QUESTIONS.md \u00b7 Joseph\u2019s clarification recorded Aug 2 \u00b7 Verbal guidance, not a written endorsement",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 501,
    "width": 803,
    "height": 12.2,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "14",
    "x": 875,
    "y": 500,
    "width": 36,
    "height": 14.64,
    "size": 12
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "The mistaken premise",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "A collaborator question said\nthere was no prior MINERvA\n3D unfolding result.\n\nThat premise was wrong.",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "The corrected framing",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "MINERvA already had a\n3D unfolding publication.\n\nThe distinction here is the\nunbinned simultaneous method.",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "A working pipeline does not establish the novelty of its research claim.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 417,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 29.28,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "slide": 14,
    "text": "This correction does not establish who introduced the error or how much AI contributed.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 474,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 18.3,
    "size": 15
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "04 / BECOMING A RESEARCHER",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 24,
    "width": 860,
    "height": 13.42,
    "size": 11
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "I have a high-level map. Do I understand the details?",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 52,
    "width": 872,
    "height": 35.2,
    "size": 32
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "Joseph\u2019s account \u00b7 Possible benefits of abstraction are hypotheses, not measured learning outcomes",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 501,
    "width": 803,
    "height": 12.2,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "15",
    "x": 875,
    "y": 500,
    "width": 36,
    "height": 14.64,
    "size": 12
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "My honest answer",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "AI abstracts so much away\nthat I am unsure what I could\nexplain without it.\n\nI can see the overall approach.",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "The tradeoff I want to test",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "Abstraction might help me avoid\ngetting stuck in a rabbit hole.\n\nIt might also hide a mistake\nI cannot recognize or explain.",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 122.0,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "A useful check: predict a change before asking the model.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 421,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 29.28,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "slide": 15,
    "text": "Then explain the result and trace the evidence without relying on the model\u2019s summary.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 465,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 19.52,
    "size": 16
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "05 / WHAT I TAKE INTO THE NEXT PROJECT",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 24,
    "width": 860,
    "height": 13.42,
    "size": 11
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "Real research output; an unresolved net benefit",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 52,
    "width": 872,
    "height": 35.2,
    "size": 32
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "Personal case study \u00b7 No matched no-AI baseline, model ranking, human-hours estimate or learning score",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 501,
    "width": 803,
    "height": 12.2,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "16",
    "x": 875,
    "y": 500,
    "width": 36,
    "height": 14.64,
    "size": 12
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "What I would keep",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "Freely asking basic questions.\nHelp implementing unfamiliar work.\nExternal references and closure\nas tests of research outputs.",
    "x": 68,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 97.6,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "What I would change",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 158,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 24.4,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "Smaller, bounded experiments.\nSimpler recurring operations.\nTrack my intervention time.\nPractice explaining key decisions.",
    "x": 509,
    "y": 196.4,
    "width": 383,
    "height": 97.6,
    "size": 20
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "What should a student demonstrate before delegating this much?",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 421,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 29.28,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "slide": 16,
    "text": "Judge the accepted research result, the total effort, and the student\u2019s understanding separately.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 465,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 19.52,
    "size": 16
  },
  {
    "slide": 17,
    "text": "BACKUP / FULL COMPARISON",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 24,
    "width": 860,
    "height": 13.42,
    "size": 11
  },
