    "width": 860,
    "height": 13.42,
    "size": 11
  },
  {
    "slide": 19,
    "text": "A reassuring ratio can hide the wrong quantity",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 52,
    "width": 872,
    "height": 35.2,
    "size": 32
  },
  {
    "slide": 19,
    "text": "2D agreement receipt, Aug 21 \u00b7 Values re-derived from recorded operands \u00b7 Ratios rounded",
    "x": 44,
    "y": 501,
    "width": 803,
    "height": 12.2,
    "size": 10
  },
  {
    "slide": 19,
    "text": "19",
    "x": 875,
    "y": 500,
    "width": 36,
    "height": 14.64,
    "size": 12
  },
  {
    "slide": 19,
    "text": "A differential cross section needs bin areas to become a total.",
    "x": 55,
    "y": 126,
    "width": 850,
    "height": 29.28,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
